WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.760
You find the sheet music, but you can't find
a good backing track to play along with.

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:10.200
I had a violin performance coming up
and had started putting together my repertoire.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:18.140
Then someone sent me this library with 42 ready-made
setlists and professional backing tracks paired with scores.

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:23.000
There's music for weddings, ceremonies,
receptions, dinners, and other events.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.640
The video mentions over 300 tracks. Check the catalog
for the current selection and choose a setlist to rehearse.

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:30.440
Use the button below to access the complete library.
